    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "Ninety centimeters. Three knocks. A hole in the wall."
      },
      {
        "text": "So Nadia bought an inspection camera. A tiny lens on a cable.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.45
      },
      {
        "text": "She fed it through the hole.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.3
      },
      {
        "text": "On her phone, a room appeared. Narrow. Dusty. No door.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "A chair, facing the wall.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.55
      },
      {
        "text": "A desk.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "And on the desk, a sheet of paper.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.4
      },
      {
        "text": "A floor plan. Of their house. In pencil.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "Huh. Previous owner was an architect too, I guess.",
        "speaker": "theo",
        "pauseBefore": 0.45
      },
      {
        "text": "Two small figures were drawn in the bedrooms.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.4
      },
      {
        "text": "Nadia zoomed in.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.35
      },
      {
        "text": "The one in Theo's room wore a blue hoodie.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "Theo. When did you buy that hoodie?",
        "speaker": "nadia",
        "speed": 0.95,
        "pauseBefore": 0.8
      },
      {
        "text": "Yesterday. Why?",
        "speaker": "theo",
        "pauseBefore": 0.35
      },
      {
        "text": "Someone drew that plan after they moved in.",
        "speed": 0.98,
        "pauseBefore": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Part three.",
        "pauseBefore": 1.0
      }
    ]
  },
